  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi></math></p><p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>C</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>It is given that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi><mi>β</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>β</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>It is given that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
